      "description": "Your media server, on every Apple device.\n\nReelo gives your personal media library a beautiful home on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple TV. Connect to the Plex, Emby, Jellyfin, or Stremio account you already use, browse your library, and start watching without moving or re-uploading your files.\n\nYOUR LIBRARY, YOUR SERVER\nReelo streams directly from the personal media server you control. Your media remains on your own hardware, with no Reelo cloud library or media hosting.\n\nDESIGNED FOR APPLE\nEnjoy a fluid experience across iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple TV.\n\nPICK UP WHERE YOU LEFT OFF\nYour watch progress syncs through your media server, so you can start on one device and continue on another.\n\nFIND SOMETHING FAST\nSearch your libraries and browse rich metadata, posters, and collections.\n\nPLAYBACK THAT FITS YOUR LIBRARY\nEnjoy high-bitrate video, 4K and HDR content, surround sound, and subtitles when supported by your device and server. When direct playback is not available, your server can transcode compatible content.\n\nGET STARTED\n1. Install Reelo.\n2. Choose Plex, Emby, Jellyfin, or Stremio.\n3. Sign in to your existing account.\n4. Select something from your personal library and press play.\n\nReelo is an independent client and does not provide, host, or supply media content. A compatible personal media server and account are required. Availability of features, formats, and transcoding depends on your device, server, and server configuration.\n\nPlex, Emby, Jellyfin, and Stremio are trademarks of their respective owners. Reelo is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.",
